{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"jq '[.modules[] | select(.id|test(\\\"\"'^p2-socs-\"))][6:15] | map({id,titleEn,titleHa,textExplanationHa,audioScript,microPauses,quizQuestions})'\"' app/content.json\"","aggregated_output":"[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-07\",\n    \"titleEn\": \"The Market\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Kasuwa\",\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Kasuwa wuri ne da mutane suke saye da sayarwa. A kasuwa za ka iya ganin kayan abinci kamar shinkafa, wake, tumatir, albasa, da kayan miya. Za ka iya ganin tufafi, takalma, littattafai, ko kayan gida. Masu sayarwa suna nuna kaya, masu saya kuma suna tambayar farashi. Idan ka je kasuwa da babba, ka tsaya kusa da shi, ka saurara, kada ka yi gudu a cikin cunkoso. Kuɗi yana da muhimmanci a kasuwa, don haka a kula da shi. Ka yi magana cikin ladabi idan kana tambayar farashi. Kada ka taɓa kayan mutum ba tare da izini ba. Kasuwa tana taimaka wa al’umma saboda mutane suna samun abin da suke bukata, kuma masu sana’a suna samun kuɗin shiga. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Kasuwa. [MAIN] Kasuwa wuri ne da mutane suke saye da sayarwa. A kasuwa za ka iya ganin kayan abinci kamar shinkafa, wake, tumatir, albasa, da kayan miya. Za ka iya ganin tufafi, takalma, littattafai, ko kayan gida. Masu sayarwa suna nuna kaya, masu saya kuma suna tambayar farashi. [PAUSE 1] Ina ake saye da sayarwa? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me ake tambaya kafin saye? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Ina ake saye da sayarwa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"kasuwa\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"asibiti\",\n          \"ƙofar gida\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me ake tambaya kafin saye?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"farashi\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"farashi\",\n          \"launin sama\",\n          \"sunan kogi\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ina ake saye da sayarwa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kasuwa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"asibiti\",\n          \"ƙofar gida\",\n          \"filin wasa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ake tambaya kafin saye?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"farashi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"launin sama\",\n          \"sunan kogi\",\n          \"adadin taurari\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi idan ka je kasuwa da babba?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"tsaya kusa da shi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"gudu cikin cunkoso\",\n          \"ɓacewa\",\n          \"taɓa kaya ba izini\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane abu ake amfani da shi wajen saye?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kuɗi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ƙura\",\n          \"ganye\",\n          \"toka\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me kasuwa take taimaka wa mutane su samu?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"abin da suke bukata\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya kawai\",\n          \"faɗa\",\n          \"rashin tsari\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-08\",\n    \"titleEn\": \"Rules at Home and School\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Dokoki a Gida da Makaranta\",\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Dokoki su ne ƙa’idoji da suke taimaka wa mutane su zauna lafiya cikin tsari. A gida, iyaye na iya cewa ka wanke hannu kafin cin abinci, ka dawo da kaya wurinsu, ko ka yi magana cikin ladabi. A makaranta, malamai na iya cewa ka zo da wuri, ka saurara a aji, ka ɗaga hannu kafin magana, kuma ka kula da littafi. Dokoki ba don tsoro kawai ba ne; suna kare ka da sauran mutane. Idan babu doka, mutane za su yi abin da suka ga dama, sai hayaniya da matsala su ƙaru. Ka bi doka cikin natsuwa, ka tambayi babba idan ba ka gane ba. Yaro mai bin doka yana samun aminci, ilimi, da girmamawa daga mutane. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Dokoki a Gida da Makaranta. [MAIN] Dokoki su ne ƙa’idoji da suke taimaka wa mutane su zauna lafiya cikin tsari. A gida, iyaye na iya cewa ka wanke hannu kafin cin abinci, ka dawo da kaya wurinsu, ko ka yi magana cikin ladabi. A makaranta, malamai na iya cewa ka zo da wuri, ka saurara a aji, ka ɗaga hannu kafin magana, kuma ka kula da littafi. Dokoki ba don tsoro kawai ba ne; suna kare ka da sauran mutane. [PAUSE 1] Me dokoki suke taimakawa a gida da makaranta? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me ya kamata ka yi kafin magana a aji? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me dokoki suke taimakawa a gida da makaranta?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"tsari\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"tsari\",\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"rashin ladabi\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi kafin magana a aji?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"ɗaga hannu\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"ɗaga hannu\",\n          \"yin ihu\",\n          \"barin aji\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me dokoki suke taimakawa a gida da makaranta?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"tsari\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"rashin ladabi\",\n          \"faɗa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi kafin magana a aji?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"ɗaga hannu\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"yin ihu\",\n          \"barin aji\",\n          \"buga teburi\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane doka ce ta gida?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"wanke hannu kafin abinci\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"jefa shara\",\n          \"ɓoye littafi\",\n          \"gudu da wuƙa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me doka take yi wa mutane?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kare su\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ɓata su\",\n          \"tsoratar da su kawai\",\n          \"raba su\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Yaro mai bin doka yana samun me?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"girmamawa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"rashin aminci\",\n          \"faɗa\",\n          \"tsokana\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-09\",\n    \"titleEn\": \"Leaders in the Community\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Shugabanni a Cikin Al’umma\",\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Shugabanni a cikin al’umma mutane ne da suke taimaka wa jama’a su bi tsari. A gida, iyaye suna jagorantar yara. A makaranta, shugaban makaranta da malamai suna taimaka wa ɗalibai. A unguwa, ana iya samun mai unguwa ko dattijo da mutane suke saurara saboda kwarewa da ladabi. Shugaba mai kyau yana sauraren mutane, yana ƙarfafa zaman lafiya, kuma yana taimaka wa jama’a su kiyaye doka. Wannan darasi ba batun jam’iyya ba ne; yana koya maka ma’anar jagoranci cikin sauƙi. Ya kamata ka girmama shugabanni masu kyau, ka bi umarni na aminci, kuma ka faɗa wa babba idan wani umarni ya sa ka cikin haɗari. Kai ma za ka iya nuna jagoranci ta hanyar gaskiya, taimako, da ladabi. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Shugabanni a Cikin Al’umma. [MAIN] Shugabanni a cikin al’umma mutane ne da suke taimaka wa jama’a su bi tsari. A gida, iyaye suna jagorantar yara. A makaranta, shugaban makaranta da malamai suna taimaka wa ɗalibai. A unguwa, ana iya samun mai unguwa ko dattijo da mutane suke saurara saboda kwarewa da ladabi. [PAUSE 1] Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"iyaye\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"iyaye\",\n          \"ƙwallo\",\n          \"hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"sauraro\",\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"rashin gaskiya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"iyaye\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ƙwallo\",\n          \"hanya\",\n          \"kujera\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wa ke taimaka wa ɗalibai a makaranta?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"malamai\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"direbobi kawai\",\n          \"masu wasa\",\n          \"ƙananan yara\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"rashin gaskiya\",\n          \"faɗa kullum\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me shugaba mai kyau yake ƙarfafawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"zaman lafiya\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙin doka\",\n          \"ɓata hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ta yaya yaro zai nuna jagoranci?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"taimako da ladabi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"ɓoye gaskiya\",\n          \"ƙin sauraro\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-10\",\n    \"titleEn\": \"Cooperation\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Haɗin Kai\",\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Haɗin kai yana nufin mutane su yi aiki tare domin cimma abu mai kyau. A gida, yara za su iya haɗa kai wajen gyara ɗaki ko tattara kayan wasa. A makaranta, ɗalibai za su iya haɗa kai wajen share aji, raba littattafai, ko taimaka wa wanda bai fahimta ba. A unguwa, mutane na iya haɗa kai wajen tsaftace hanya ko kula da wurin ruwa. Haɗin kai yana rage wahala saboda aiki yana rabuwa tsakanin mutane. Hakanan yana koya maka sauraro, hakuri, da girmama ra’ayin wasu. Idan kana aiki tare da abokai, kada ka yi umarni da fushi. Ka saurari kowa, ka yi naka ɓangare, ka kuma gode wa wanda ya taimaka. Al’umma mai haɗin kai tana samun zaman lafiya da ci gaba.\",\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Haɗin Kai. [MAIN] Haɗin kai yana nufin mutane su yi aiki tare domin cimma abu mai kyau. A gida, yara za su iya haɗa kai wajen gyara ɗaki ko tattara kayan wasa. A makaranta, ɗalibai za su iya haɗa kai wajen share aji, raba littattafai, ko taimaka wa wanda bai fahimta ba. A unguwa, mutane na iya haɗa kai wajen tsaftace hanya ko kula da wurin ruwa. [PAUSE 1] Me haɗin kai yake nufi? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me haɗin kai yake ragewa? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake nufi?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"aiki tare\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"aiki tare\",\n          \"yin faɗa\",\n          \"ɓoye kaya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake ragewa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"wahala\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"wahala\",\n          \"taimako\",\n          \"zaman lafiya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake nufi?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"aiki tare\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"yin faɗa\",\n          \"ɓoye kaya\",\n          \"ƙin magana\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane aiki ɗalibai za su iya yi tare?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"share aji\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"lalata aji\",\n          \"jefa littafi\",\n          \"tsokana\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake ragewa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"wahala\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"taimako\",\n          \"zaman lafiya\",\n          \"farin ciki\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane hali ake bukata wajen haɗin kai?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"fushi\",\n          \"rashin hakuri\",\n          \"raini\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi wa wanda ya taimaka?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"gode masa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokane shi\",\n          \"mantawa da shi\",\n          \"ɓoye masa kaya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-11\",\n    \"titleEn\": \"Nigerian Symbols\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Alamomin Nijeriya\",\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Alamomin Nijeriya abubuwa ne da suke tunatar da mu ƙasarmu. Misalai masu sauƙi su ne tutar Nijeriya, tambarin Nijeriya, taken ƙasa, kuɗin Nijeriya, da launukan kore da fari. Tuta tana da kore, fari, kore. Launin kore yana iya tunatar da mu noma da albarkatun ƙasa, fari kuma yana iya nuni da zaman lafiya. Kuɗin Nijeriya shi ne naira da kobo. Taken ƙasa waƙa ce da ake yi cikin girmamawa a wasu lokuta na makaranta ko taro. Ya kamata ka girmama alamomin ƙasa, kada ka lalata tuta ko wasa da kuɗi. Wannan darasi yana koya maka ka san abubuwan da ke nuna Nijeriya cikin sauƙi, ba tare da shiga siyasa ba. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Alamomin Nijeriya. [MAIN] Alamomin Nijeriya abubuwa ne da suke tunatar da mu ƙasarmu. Misalai masu sauƙi su ne tutar Nijeriya, tambarin Nijeriya, taken ƙasa, kuɗin Nijeriya, da launukan kore da fari. Tuta tana da kore, fari, kore. Launin kore yana iya tunatar da mu noma da albarkatun ƙasa, fari kuma yana iya nuni da zaman lafiya. [PAUSE 1] Wane launi ne yake cikin tutar Nijeriya? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Menene kuɗin Nijeriya? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wane launi ne yake cikin tutar Nijeriya?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"kore\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"kore\",\n          \"ruwan hoda\",\n          \"baki\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Menene kuɗin Nijeriya?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"naira\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"naira\",\n          \"dutse\",\n          \"ganye\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane launi ne yake cikin tutar Nijeriya?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kore\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ruwan hoda\",\n          \"baki\",\n          \"shunayya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Menene kuɗin Nijeriya?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"naira\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"dutse\",\n          \"ganye\",\n          \"ƙwallo\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Tutar Nijeriya tana da launuka nawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"biyu\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"uku\",\n          \"huɗu\",\n          \"biyar\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi wa alamomin ƙasa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"girmama su\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"lalata su\",\n          \"wasa da su\",\n          \"ɓoye su\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane abu ne alamar Nijeriya?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"tambarin Nijeriya\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"takalmi\",\n          \"tabarma\",\n          \"kwando\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-12\",\n    \"titleEn\": \"Respect and Good Behaviour\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Girmamawa da Kyawawan Halaye\",\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Girmamawa tana nufin nuna mutunci ga mutane ta magana da aiki. Kyawawan halaye su ne abubuwan da ke sa mutane su amince da kai, kamar gaskiya, ladabi, taimako, hakuri, da tsabta. A gida, ka gaishe iyaye da manya. A makaranta, ka saurari malami, ka jira lokacinka kafin magana, ka kuma kula da littattafai. A kasuwa ko hanya, ka yi magana cikin natsuwa, kada ka ture mutane. Idan ka yi kuskure, ka ce ka yi hakuri. Idan wani ya taimaka maka, ka ce na gode. Girmamawa ba ta sa ka zama rauni; tana nuna tarbiyya. Yaro mai kyawawan halaye yana samun abokai, amincewa, da zaman lafiya. Ka riƙa zaɓar kalmomi masu kyau kullum. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Girmamawa da Kyawawan Halaye. [MAIN] Girmamawa tana nufin nuna mutunci ga mutane ta magana da aiki. Kyawawan halaye su ne abubuwan da ke sa mutane su amince da kai, kamar gaskiya, ladabi, taimako, hakuri, da tsabta. A gida, ka gaishe iyaye da manya. A makaranta, ka saurari malami, ka jira lokacinka kafin magana, ka kuma kula da littattafai. [PAUSE 1] Me girmamawa take nufi? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me za ka ce idan wani ya taimaka maka? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me girmamawa take nufi?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"nuna mutunci\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"nuna mutunci\",\n          \"yin hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙin magana\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me za ka ce idan wani ya taimaka maka?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"na gode\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"na gode\",\n          \"ka tafi\",\n          \"ba komai ba\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me girmamawa take nufi?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"nuna mutunci\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"yin hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙin magana\",\n          \"tsokana\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane hali ne mai kyau?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"gaskiya\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ƙarya\",\n          \"rashin ladabi\",\n       