{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"grep -nE 'dimok|kundin tsarin|zaɓe|zaɓin|ƙuri|UNCRC|United Nations|Convention|Democracy|Election|voting|migration|urban|ward' tools/p4-batch/p4-socs-complete.json tools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json\"","aggregated_output":"tools/p4-batch/p4-socs-complete.json:206:    \"titleEn\": \"Democracy and Elections\",\ntools/p4-batch/p4-socs-complete.json:210:    \"textExplanationHa\": \"A Nijeriya, jama’a suna shiga zaɓin masu jagoranci ta hanyar da doka ta tsara. Mutanen da doka ta ba dama suna yin rajista, su je wurin da aka tanada, su nuna mutum guda da suke so ya wakilce su, sau ɗaya kuma cikin sirri. Wannan yana sa muryar kowane mai shiga ta sami daraja iri ɗaya. Hukumar INEC ce take shirya wannan aiki a matakin ƙasa, tana koyar da jama’a, tana tanadar wurare, sannan ana ƙirga abin da mutane suka nuna. Dole ne aikin ya kasance cikin gaskiya, natsuwa, da bin doka. Ba a tilasta wa mutum ya nuna wanda wani yake so ba, kuma ba a sayen ra’ayinsa da kyauta. Ƴan ƙasa suna da rawar sauraron bayani, tambayar abin da bai bayyana ba, girmama ra’ayin wasu, da karɓar hanyar doka idan suna da ƙorafi. Yara ba sa shiga wannan aikin na manya, amma za su iya koyon gaskiya, sauraro, da yadda ake yanke shawara cikin adalci. Darasin ba ya goyon bayan jam’iyya, mutum, ko ra’ayi na siyasa.\",\ntools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json:30:    \"safetyNote\": \"Mandatory neutrality review: geography/civics only, with no historical narrative, pre-colonial kingdom, colonial content, migration grievance, conflict zone, ethnic overlay, resource-ownership claim, or implication that resources follow exact hard boundaries.\"\ntools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json:65:    \"titleEn\": \"Democracy and Elections\",\ntools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json:70:    \"safetyNote\": \"No party, candidate, slogan, ideology, party colour, ballot choice text, result prediction, campaign crowd, inducement, intimidation, child voting, or endorsement; balance gender, region, disability, and dress without profiling.\"\ntools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json:100:    \"safetyNote\": \"Do not rank rural or urban life, show slums as spectacle, publish a population number, expose household details, stereotype poverty, imply every village or city looks alike, or tie settlement type to ethnicity.\"\ntools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json:110:    \"safetyNote\": \"No trafficking, forced displacement, conflict zone, border crossing, ethnic blame, criminalisation of newcomers, poverty caricature, child moving alone, or claim that movement is always rural-to-urban or always beneficial.\"\ntools/image-manifest/p4-socs-image-manifest.json:150:    \"safetyNote\": \"Keep all topics equal; no historical narrative, kingdom or colonial imagery, ethnic ranking, party or candidate, child voting, child labor, poverty spectacle, dangerous industry, exam score, or implication that one region represents all Nigeria.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
