{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_66","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"node <<'NODE'\nconst fs=require('fs');const b=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('tools/p4-batch/p4-socs-complete.json'));const q5=b.map(m=>[m.id,m.quizQuestions[4].templateHa]);const out=b.map(m=>{const x=m.audioScript.match(/\\\\[OUTRO\\\\] (.*)\"'$/u);return [m.id,x?x[1]:'\"'']});const dup=a=>a.filter((x,i)=>a.findIndex(y=>y[1]===x[1])\"'!==i);console.log(`Q5 exact duplicates: ${dup(q5).length}`);for(const x of q5)console.log(`${x[0]} Q5: ${x[1]}`);console.log(`OUTRO exact duplicates: ${dup(out).length}`);for(const x of out)console.log(`${x[0]} OUTRO: ${x[1]}`);process.exitCode=dup(q5).length||dup(out).length?1:0;\nNODE'","aggregated_output":"Q5 exact duplicates: 0\np4-socs-01 Q5: Me ya kamata ka fara nema idan ka duba taswirar Nijeriya?\np4-socs-02 Q5: Me haɗin kan al’ummomi yake yi wa Nijeriya?\np4-socs-03 Q5: Me bambancin yanayin ƙasa yake iya shafawa?\np4-socs-04 Q5: Waɗanne halaye taken ƙasa da alkawari suke tunatarwa?\np4-socs-05 Q5: Me ya sa hukumomi suke haɗa hannu?\np4-socs-06 Q5: Me duba ayyukan juna tsakanin rassan yake ƙarfafawa?\np4-socs-07 Q5: Waɗanne ƙa’idodi uku ne suke kare wannan aikin?\np4-socs-08 Q5: Waɗanne mutane ne noma yake ba aikin yi?\np4-socs-09 Q5: Wane tsari kaya zai iya bi kafin mai amfani ya same shi?\np4-socs-10 Q5: Me ake bukata idan jama’a sun yi yawa a wuri?\np4-socs-11 Q5: Yaya ya kamata a karɓi sababbin mazauna?\np4-socs-12 Q5: Wane bambanci ne tsakanin taimakon gaggawa da na dogon lokaci?\np4-socs-13 Q5: Me kare haƙƙin yara yake ba su damar yi?\np4-socs-14 Q5: Waɗanne matakai ne suke sa aikin rukuni ya yi kyau?\np4-socs-15 Q5: Wane jerin ne ya haɗa manyan ayyukan tattalin arziki da aka yi bita?\nOUTRO exact duplicates: 0\np4-socs-01 OUTRO: Ka nuna jiharku a taswirar Nijeriya, ka faɗi babban birninta, sannan ka nuna inda Abuja take ba tare da ba da labarin tarihi ba.\np4-socs-02 OUTRO: Ka faɗi harsuna biyu da ake ji a yankinku, sannan ka bayyana yadda sauraro cikin ladabi yake gina haɗin kai ba tare da fifita wata al’umma ba.\np4-socs-03 OUTRO: Ka duba taswirar yanayin Nijeriya ka nuna Sahel, filayen ciyawa, dazuzzuka, da koguna biyu; ka tsaya ga bayanin ƙasa kawai, ba tarihin wani zamani ba.\np4-socs-04 OUTRO: Lokacin da ka ga tuta ko ka ji taken ƙasa, ka tuna da zaman lafiya, hidima, gaskiya, da haɗin kan dukkan ƴan Nijeriya.\np4-socs-05 OUTRO: Idan ka ga buƙatar kasuwa, makaranta, ko babbar hanya, ka tambayi wane matakin gwamnati ne zai iya shiga da kuma wanda zai haɗa hannu da shi.\np4-socs-06 OUTRO: Ka haɗa kowane aiki da reshensa: aiwatar da doka, tsara doka, ko warware saɓani bisa doka; wannan rarrabewa tana kare adalci.\np4-socs-07 OUTRO: Ka tuna da ƙa’idodi uku na wannan aikin: kowane mutum sau ɗaya, sirri, da ƙirga abin da jama’a suka nuna cikin gaskiya—ba tare da nuna goyon bayan kowa ba.\np4-socs-08 OUTRO: Ka bi tafiyar gyada ko gero daga gona zuwa ajiya, sarrafawa, sufuri, da kasuwa, sannan ka faɗi aikin kowane mutum a wannan tafiya.\np4-socs-09 OUTRO: Ka zaɓi auduga, hatsi, ko fata, ka bi matakanta daga albarkatun ƙasa zuwa masana’anta, sufuri, kasuwa, da mai amfani.\np4-socs-10 OUTRO: Ka kwatanta ƙauye da birni ta yawan gidaje da hidimomi, sannan ka bayyana dalilin da ya sa ƙidayar jama’a take taimaka wa shiri.\np4-socs-11 OUTRO: Ka zana kibiyar motsi daga ƙauye zuwa birni ko akasin haka, ka rubuta dalili ɗaya, dama ɗaya, da hidima ɗaya da za a ƙara.\np4-socs-12 OUTRO: Ka bambanta taimakon gaggawa, kamar abinci, da taimakon dogon lokaci, kamar ilimi ko koyon sana’a; dukansu su kiyaye mutuncin mutum.\np4-socs-13 OUTRO: Ka tuna bambanci: taimako mai sauƙi da aminci yana iya dacewa da shekaru; aikin da ya hana makaranta, hutu, ko lafiya yana bukatar kariyar babba.\np4-socs-14 OUTRO: Ka shirya ƙaramin aikin rukuni: ku bayyana manufa, ku raba aiki daidai, ku saurari kowa, sannan ku duba abin da haɗin kai ya inganta.\np4-socs-15 OUTRO: Ka zaɓi jigogi biyar—ƙasa, jama’a, gwamnati, tattalin arziki, matsuguni, matsalolin al’umma, haƙƙin yara, ko haɗin kai—ka faɗi gaskiya ɗaya da aikin ɗan ƙasa ɗaya daga kowanne.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
